"When we publish a new QWT version, it’s usually pushed to the ``current-"
"testing`` or ``unstable`` repository first. To use versions from current-"
"testing, run this in dom0:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-tools.rst:635
#: 371e1d9ca62b451fa93e0b2126a8ba31
msgid ""
"That command will download a new QWT ``iso`` file from the testing "
"repository. It goes without saying that you should **backup your VMs** "
"before installing anything from testing repos."
